{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess of Mana</strong> is chess with a <strong>twist</strong> \u2014 a magical battlefield where capturing pieces ain\u2019t the end... it\u2019s just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant fantasy world, <strong>Celts and Orcs face off with strategy <i>and</i> a little magical boost called Mana</strong> \u2014 with it, you can bring fallen pieces back to life and flip the game in wild, unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget being scared to make bold moves and lose your pieces! In <strong>Chess of Mana</strong>, every turn can spark a comeback, and every piece you lose might just rejoin the fight. Here, <strong>the King\u2019s not just some target \u2014 he\u2019s the one holding all the Mana power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>colorful pixel art</strong>, <strong>goofy</strong> and <strong>charming</strong> <strong>animations</strong>, and a playful vibe that blends classic strategy with fantasy flair, this game invites you <strong>to try a whole new style of chess</strong> \u2014 where creativity, boldness, and magic go hand in hand on the board!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778350?t=1759846947","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/28e9edd2ffdbca0ee1e47e90b8fc61e9d9d6abd5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759846947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/28f035ef46a49694782df7994c40d361f8d65179/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759846947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/28f035ef46a49694782df7994c40d361f8d65179/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759846947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chess of Mana</strong> is chess with a <strong>twist</strong> \u2014 a magical battlefield where capturing pieces ain\u2019t the end... it\u2019s just the beginning!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vibrant fantasy world, <strong>Celts and Orcs face off with strategy <i>and</i> a little magical boost called Mana</strong> \u2014 with it, you can bring fallen pieces back to life and flip the game in wild, unexpected ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget being scared to make bold moves and lose your pieces! In <strong>Chess of Mana</strong>, every turn can spark a comeback, and every piece you lose might just rejoin the fight. Here, <strong>the King\u2019s not just some target \u2014 he\u2019s the one holding all the Mana power.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>colorful pixel art</strong>, <strong>goofy</strong> and <strong>charming</strong> <strong>animations</strong>, and a playful vibe that blends classic strategy with fantasy flair, this game invites you <strong>to try a whole new style of chess</strong> \u2014 where creativity, boldness, and magic go hand in hand on the board!</p>","developers":["Monk Monkey"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778350/1d7856002d1032075f03a417893961cf9ef161a8/header.jpg?t=1759846947","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<stron